---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import SectionDots from '../SectionDots.astro';
---

<section id="unlocking" class="section intro">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="intro__title" data-reveal>Unlocking the telecom network for innovation</h2>
    <p class="intro__lead" data-reveal>
      Slicce cloud communication engines are cloud-native, self-contained microservices designed to
      streamline access to telecom interfaces, facilitating the rapid adoption of scalable network
      services. They enable seamless interworking across network generations and promote convergence
      between telecom network APIs and public web APIs.
    </p>

    <div class="intro__columns">
      <div class="intro__column" data-reveal="left">
        <h3>The Simplest way to adopt<br />cloud native</h3>
        <span class="intro__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p>
          Slicce ensures smooth migration of legacy services to modern infrastructure, while keeping
          costs low and maintaining agility to quickly adapt to evolving market needs.
        </p>
        <Icon name="cloud-native" size={72} />
        <span class="intro__column-label">Cloud Native</span>
      </div>

      <div class="intro__column" data-reveal="right">
        <h3>The Fastest way to offer<br />smart VAS</h3>
        <span class="intro__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p>
          Slicce enables seamless and quick development of new value-added services to create
          competitive differentiation and generate revenue streams through innovation.
        </p>
        <Icon name="open-api" size={72} />
        <span class="intro__column-label">Open API</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SectionDots active={1} />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro__title {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.2vw, 2rem);
  }

  .intro__lead {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .intro__columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-16);
    margin-top: var(--space-16);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro__column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .intro__column h3 {
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .intro__divider {
    display: block;
    width: 96px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--color-green);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .intro__column p {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 270px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  .intro__column-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .intro__columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-12);
    }
  }
</style>
